      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Maschil of David; A Prayer when he was in the cave.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 142:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I cried unto the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.142.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.142.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.142.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.142.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with my voice; with my voice unto the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.142.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.142.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.142.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.142.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "did I make my supplication.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.142.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.142.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 142:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I poured out my complaint before him; I shewed before him my trouble.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.142.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.142.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 142:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When my spirit was overwhelmed within me, then thou knewest my path. In the way wherein I walked have they privily laid a snare for me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.142.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.142.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 142:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I looked on",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.142.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.142.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "my",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.142.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.142.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "right hand, and beheld, but",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.142.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.142.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.142.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.142.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no man that would know me: refuge failed me; no man cared for my soul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.142.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.142.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 142:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I cried unto thee, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.142.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.142.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.142.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.142.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": I said, Thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.142.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.142.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.142.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.142.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my refuge",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.142.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.142.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.142.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.142.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my portion in the land of the living.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.142.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.142.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 142:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Attend unto my cry; for I am brought very low: deliver me from my persecutors; for they are stronger than I.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.142.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.142.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 142:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bring my soul out of prison, that I may praise thy name: the righteous shall compass me about; for thou shalt deal bountifully with me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.142.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.142.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
